This product bundles:
  * arjuna_pdf/data/pdf.ttf — the "GlyphLessFont" from Tesseract OCR (https://github.com/tesseract-ocr/tesseract),
    Apache License 2.0, Copyright Google Inc. / Tesseract contributors (arjuna_pdf/data/pdf.ttf.LICENSE-Apache-2.0.txt).

The invisible text-layer technique (one glyph per code point, identity ToUnicode, per-word horizontal scaling) follows
Tesseract's TessPDFRenderer (Apache-2.0); the code here is an independent implementation.

OCR is performed by Arjuna-OCR (separate packages, Apache-2.0 code; the layout model file is AGPL-3.0 — see the Arjuna
model cards). This repository does not contain or redistribute any PDF24 Creator code or binaries.
